  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wet 201.05 Issuance of Documents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ec-Wet 201.05 Issuance of Documents. All orders, decisions, notices, or other written correspondence or documents issued by or at the direction of the council or presiding officer shall be rebuttably presumed to have been issued on the date noted on the document.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ec-Wet 100) #13305, eff 12-15-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ec-wet100-200.html"
